WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:01.585
Arequipa, Peru.

00:02.188 --> 00:04.167
On a rooftop beneath the Misti volcano,

00:04.539 --> 00:06.540
a kid kept asking the same question:

00:07.111 --> 00:08.200
how do you get up there?

00:08.739 --> 00:10.862
The first answer came from this same land.

00:11.316 --> 00:14.491
Pedro Paulet, an engineer who, according to his own account,

00:14.892 --> 00:18.256
tested a liquid-fuel rocket engine in Paris in the 1890s.

00:18.826 --> 00:20.504
That kid grew up to be a physicist.

00:20.939 --> 00:21.357
His name:

00:21.838 --> 00:22.783
Pedro Goicochea.

00:23.256 --> 00:23.892
And his mission...

00:24.458 --> 00:26.000
is about to become yours.
